		"description": "Comprehensive testing collection for the Event Planner Budget Service through the API Gateway. This collection includes all budget management endpoints, expense tracking, and financial reporting.\n\n## Setup Instructions:\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Set the base URL environment variable (see below)\n3. Follow the testing sequence in order\n\n## Environment Variables:\n- `base_url`: http://localhost:8080 (API Gateway URL)\n- `auth_token`: JWT token from Auth Service (set after login)\n- `budget_id`: Will be set automatically after creating a budget\n- `expense_id`: Will be set automatically after creating an expense\n\n## Testing Sequence:\n1. Start with Health Check\n2. Test Swagger UI access\n3. Test OpenAPI documentation\n4. Test direct access (should fail)\n5. Test X-Internal-Auth mechanism",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
